See `docs/VM_CAPABILITIES.md`, `docs/VM_DAP.md`, `docs/VM_EXCEPTIONS_MODULES.md`, `docs/BYTECODE_AND_VM.md`, and `docs/TYPE_SYSTEM.md`.
